@BlogService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5237
@token = replace-with-access-token

### Create a blog with the authenticated author's avatar
POST {{BlogService_HostAddress}}/api/blogs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A sample blog",
  "body": "Blog content",
  "authorAvatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}

### Query blogs (responses include authorName and authorAvatarUrl)
GET {{BlogService_HostAddress}}/api/blogs
Accept: application/json
